  data: {
    LLM: "1. Each player places their card on their forehead without looking (all other players can see it). 2. Betting round(s) occur where players bet based on what they see of others' cards. 3. Players can fold if they believe their card is low. 4. Showdown: remaining players reveal cards; highest card wins.",
    Player: "1. Each player places their card on their forehead without looking (all other players can see it). 2. Betting round(s) occur where players bet based on what they see of others' cards. 3. Players can fold if they believe their card is low. 4. Showdown: remaining players reveal cards; highest card wins.",
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest card (or making others fold through betting).',
    gameplay: "1. Each player places their card on their forehead without looking (all other players can see it). 2. Betting round(s) occur where players bet based on what they see of others' cards. 3. Players can fold if they believe their card is low. 4. Showdown: remaining players reveal cards; highest card wins.",
    keyRules: [
      'Players may NEVER look at their own card',
      'All players can see all cards except their own',
      'Standard poker betting applies',
      'Highest card wins at showdown',
      "Folding is based on reading others' reactions and visible cards",
